  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to Finance Advisory</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this assignment was to obtain external expertise to feed into the design of a range of Access to Finance activities and programming.Specifically, it sought to gather insights, practical recommendations, and specialised knowledge from experienced professionals to strengthen strategic planning, enhance implementation approaches, and ensure that proposed interventions were relevant, effective, and sustainable.Ultimately, this assignment helped shape the Access to Finance initiatives that were later developed and implemented under EnDev.</narrative>
  </description>
